@Security_Camera_Backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:8080
@ApiKey = dev-only-api-key
@ApiKeySys002 = dev-only-api-key-sys-002
@AlertTerminalKeySys001 = dev-alert-terminal-key-sys-001
@TokenSys001 = paste-token-from-cam_admin_1-login
@TokenSys002 = paste-token-from-cam_admin_2-login

### Pi motion ingestion (multipart burst upload)
POST {{Security_Camera_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/events
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----boundary

------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="frame.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./frame.jpg
------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="isOfflineSync"

false
------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="clientEventId"

6f9619ff-8b86-d011-b42d-00c04fc964ff
------boundary--

### Pi motion ingestion for the second camera system
POST {{Security_Camera_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/events
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKeySys002}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----boundary

------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="frame.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./frame.jpg
------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="isOfflineSync"

false
------boundary--

### Analyze a file that already exists on the captures volume (JSON)
POST {{Security_Camera_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/events/analyze
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "imagePath": "/data/captures/test.jpg",
  "capturedAt": null,
  "isOfflineSync": false
}

### Analyze an uploaded frame (multipart)
POST {{Security_Camera_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/events/analyze
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----boundary

------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="frame.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./frame.jpg
------boundary--

### Live preview upload (raw JPEG, max 200 KB, 5 req/s per API key)
POST {{Security_Camera_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/camera/frame
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./frame.jpg

### Latest live preview frame (204 when absent or older than 10 s)
GET {{Security_Camera_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/camera/latest
Authorization: Bearer {{TokenSys001}}

### Live MJPEG stream
GET {{Security_Camera_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/camera/stream
Authorization: Bearer {{TokenSys001}}

### Device/backend/cv-service status for the authenticated system
GET {{Security_Camera_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/system/status
Authorization: Bearer {{TokenSys001}}

### Alert terminal status (X-Api-Key must belong to an AlertTerminal device)
GET {{Security_Camera_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/device/status
X-Api-Key: {{AlertTerminalKeySys001}}

### Built-in sys-001 admin login (initial password = physical device code / Admin__DeviceCode)
POST {{Security_Camera_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "CAM-0000-DEV1"
}

### Factory admin login for sys-001 (development stub)
POST {{Security_Camera_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "cam_admin_1",
  "password": "factory-pass-sys-001"
}

### Factory admin login for sys-002 (development stub)
POST {{Security_Camera_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "cam_admin_2",
  "password": "factory-pass-sys-002"
}

### Ambiguous sub-user login (same username in both systems)
POST {{Security_Camera_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alice",
  "password": "alice-pass-1"
}

### Disambiguated sub-user login
POST {{Security_Camera_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alice",
  "password": "alice-pass-1",
  "systemId": "sys-001"
}

### Current identity (includes systemId)
GET {{Security_Camera_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{TokenSys001}}

### Logout (revokes the token)
POST {{Security_Camera_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{TokenSys001}}

### Create a sub-user in the authenticated admin's system
POST {{Security_Camera_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{TokenSys001}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alice",
  "password": "alice-pass-1",
  "role": "User"
}

### List sub-users (only the admin's system)
GET {{Security_Camera_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{TokenSys001}}

### Delete a sub-user (not yourself or the factory admin)
DELETE {{Security_Camera_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{TokenSys001}}

### Paged entrance logs (only the authenticated user's system)
GET {{Security_Camera_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/events?page=1&pageSize=20&suspectOnly=false
Authorization: Bearer {{TokenSys001}}

### One entrance log
GET {{Security_Camera_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/events/1
Authorization: Bearer {{TokenSys001}}

### Event images (tenant-scoped, Cache-Control: private)
GET {{Security_Camera_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/events/1/face
Authorization: Bearer {{TokenSys001}}

###
GET {{Security_Camera_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/events/1/annotated
Authorization: Bearer {{TokenSys001}}

### Delete an event and its image files (Admin only)
DELETE {{Security_Camera_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/events/1
Authorization: Bearer {{TokenSys001}}

### Read away-mode settings (row auto-created as indefinite)
GET {{Security_Camera_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/settings/away-mode
Authorization: Bearer {{TokenSys001}}

### Update away-mode settings (legacy shape still accepted)
PUT {{Security_Camera_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/settings/away-mode
Authorization: Bearer {{TokenSys001}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "scheduled",
  "startTime": "22:00",
  "endTime": "06:00",
  "alertEmail": "alerts@example.com",
  "timeZone": "Europe/Bucharest"
}
